  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量工作台-资质管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量工作台\"],\"capability_summary\":\"适用于归属升级版巨量引擎工作台的商品库，基于入参组织层级查看当前组织下或包括下属组织管理的通用版商品库。关键配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"dpa.ebp_library.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/dpa/ebp/library/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1846200555058186\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1846200555058186\",\"title\":\"获取商品库列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_abce8c57=\"true\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VK37Q3mW\">适用场景：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-a8l6IR6I\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lMujaCEI\">商品归属：归属升级版巨量引擎工作台的商品库</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0EE85U5s\">场景：对应升级版巨量引擎工作台功能，基于入参组织层级查看当前组织下或包括下属组织管理的通用版商品库</li></ul>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201841420204568586%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-jiclpEsc\" id=\"h346b9f0-jiclpEsc\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-JalMB83J\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/dpa/ebp/library/list/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1846200555058186\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-4paQRN7E\" id=\"h346b9f0-4paQRN7E\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-hhdTJfTs\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-rh7uDLld\" id=\"h346b9f0-rh7uDLld\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Ev7TT4x3\" id=\"h346b9f0-Ev7TT4x3\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rwfbBVwj\">升级版组织id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-VOb4Cebd\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kL81jL8U\"><code>EBP</code>升级版组织</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">store_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-52KWk4fb\">商品库类型，具体枚举可参考<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1814865185951753?origin=left_nav\" target=\"_blank\">【附录-商品库枚举说明】</a></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">name_or_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2lzVbMYo\">商品库名称模糊搜索或商品库ID精确搜索</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">offset</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: none\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">limit</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_query_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-H7jvGTyd\">EBP资产查询范围</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">permission_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">权限范围，不传默认全部，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-SJ2WYAKG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6OaBbFPL\"><code>All</code> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">组织创建的及被其他组织共享的资产</span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mVU0LFKC\"><code>Authed</code> 被其他组织共享的资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-O2l2KMle\"><code>Managed</code> <span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">入参组织创建的资产</span></li></ul> 默认值: <code>Managed</code></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">hierarchy</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0TKqHFC7\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">资产归属层级范围，默认查询当前组织及下级组织全部资产，可选值: </span></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-JiC4mf7E\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ycg707pK\"><code>Direct</code> 仅查询入参组织创建/被共享的资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-q1YNcJKN\"><code>Traverse</code> 查询入参组织及下属所有组织创建的/被共享的资产</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-18VSMOoO\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\"> 默认值: </span><code>Direct</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-dhUhuTDv\" id=\"h346b9f0-dhUhuTDv\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fdpa%2Febp%2Flibrary%2Flist%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20get(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20GET%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_string%20%3D%20urlencode(%7Bk%3A%20v%20if%20isinstance(v%2C%20string_types)%20else%20json.dumps(v)%20for%20k%2C%20v%20in%20args.items()%7D)%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH%2C%20query_string)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22Access-Token%5C%22%3A%20ACCESS_TOKEN%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20rsp%20%3D%20requests.get(url%2C%20headers%3Dheaders)%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20rsp.json()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Cnif%20__name__%20%3D%3D%20'__main__'%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_id%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20account_type%20%3D%20ACCOUNT_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20store_type%20%3D%20STORE_TYPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20name_or_id%20%3D%20NAME_OR_ID%5Cn%20%20%20%20offset%20%3D%20OFFSET%5Cn%20%20%20%20limit%20%3D%20LIMIT%5Cn%20%20%20%20permission_scope%20%3D%20PERMISSION_SCOPE%5Cn%20%20%20%20hierarchy%20%3D%20HIERARCHY%5Cn%5Cn